   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Reporting a statement",
     "texto": [
      "To report a statement, use **-다고 하다**. The form changes depending on the word: adjective (피곤하다 → **피곤하다고**), present verb (가다 → **간다고**, 먹다 → **먹는다고**) and noun (학생이다 → **학생이라고**). With verbs ending in ㄹ, the ㄹ is dropped before ㄴ: 살다 → **산다고**.",
      "민수 씨가 **피곤하다고** 했어요 = Minsu said that he is tired."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Past",
     "texto": [
      "The indirect past is formed with **-았다고 / -었다고**: 갔다고 (that he went), 잤다고 (that he slept), 했다고 (that he did).",
      "What was said is put in the past with **했어요** (said)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
